 "remarks": "48 Bouton is a charming cape in Stamford's sought after Springdale neighborhood. This home offers a flexible floor plan, beautiful hardwood floors, and thoughtful updates both inside and out. Enter through the enclosed front porch and into a bright living room featuring French doors and recessed lighting, flowing into the dining area and remodeled kitchen with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances. The main level also offers a bedroom and full bathroom, providing flexibility for guests, a home office, or multi-generational living. Upstairs, there are two additional bedrooms and a renovated full bathroom.  The owners have continued to improve the property with significant upgrades, including a French drain and sump pump system, basement waterproofing, and extensive improvements to the backyard. The yard has been leveled and completely renovated to create a more functional outdoor space, with privacy evergreen trees planted to enhance the setting as they mature. Additional features include a full walk-out basement offering abundant storage and future possibilities, 200-amp electrical service, a back deck, shed, and carport.  Also located approximately 1.1 miles from the Springdale train station, with easy access to shopping, dining, schools, major highways, and everything Stamford has to offer.",
